      <a href="/docs">Docs</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/jiji262/vibeallday">GitHub</a>
      <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/vibeallday">npm</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/jiji262/vibeallday/releases">Releases</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/jiji262/vibeallday/issues">Issues</a>
